{"title": "Birthright", "pageid": 9365, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Birthright", "categories": ["Helmets", "Very rare items", "Charisma set", "Modify Ability Score set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Birthright_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Birthright_Icon.png/300px-Birthright_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Birthright_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Birthright image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Birthright_Icon.png/300px-Birthright_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Birthright_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Birthright</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Headwear</a> that gives the wearer <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> +2, up to a maximum of 22.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>'The thing that you poor sods simply cannot grasp is how effortless all this magical hootie-wootie castie-spellsie business is for me!’ - A very stupid sorcerer at a wizard academy ball.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 410 gp / 810 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  410  gp /  810  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">76ce9b38-9203-437f-9962-4be4c4ad1193</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:76ce9b38-9203-437f-9962-4be4c4ad1193\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:76ce9b38-9203-437f-9962-4be4c4ad1193\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_GleamingSorcery_Hat+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> +2 (up to 22)</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-14&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-72</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan's Projection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\">Lorroakan's Projection</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/38px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/50px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> on the ground floor</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This hat's effect can stack with the <b>Bard's Memory</b> buff from the <a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_of_Loss\" title=\"Mirror of Loss\">Mirror of Loss</a> (see <a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Bonuses#Act_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Permanent Bonuses\">Permanent Bonuses</a>), for a total <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> score of 24.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 335px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 330px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Birthright-AllDyes.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"All Dye colors\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Birthright-AllDyes.webp/209px-Birthright-AllDy